OL,3,GNEWSAActress to be awarded honorary
OL,4,Auniversity degree
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Mia McKenna-Bruce is to be
OL,7,Fawarded an honorary doctorate by
OL,8,FCanterbury Christ Church University for
OL,9,Fhelping to "elevate Kent onto the
OL,10,Fnational stage".
OL,12,FMcKenna-Bruce, a former student at
OL,13,FMaidstone Grammar School for Girls,
OL,14,Fwill receive her award for services to
OL,15,Facting, after beginning her career as a
OL,16,Fchild when she featured in the CBBC
OL,17,Fseries Tracy Beaker Returns and its
OL,18,Fspin-off The Dumping Ground.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
