OL,3,GNEWSAActress to be awarded honorary
OL,4,Auniversity degree
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has won awards including a BAFTA
OL,7,FRising Star Award and the British
OL,8,FIndependent Film Award for Best Lead
OL,9,FPerformance.
OL,11,FThe award will be given to her at a
OL,12,Fceremony at the university later in
OL,13,FSeptember.
